*.sys
# Linux 侧的 EasyTier 二进制没有扩展名，*.exe 之类的规则挡不住，需要显式忽略。
# 与 Windows 二进制同理：第三方产物、体积大，构建前用
# MCTier-Linux/scripts/fetch-binaries.sh 获取并校验 SHA-256。
src-tauri/resources/binaries/linux/
# macOS EasyTier binaries are reproducible third-party build outputs; keep only
# the architecture directories and .gitkeep files in the repository.
src-tauri/resources/binaries/macos/*/easytier-core
src-tauri/resources/binaries/macos/*/easytier-cli
src-tauri/resources/binaries/macos/*/target/
MCTier-macOS/build-logs/
MCTier-macOS/*.log
MCTier-macOS/*.dmg

# Config directories
config_mctier-*

# Test files and reports
# tests/ 不再整体忽略，否则 npm test 没有任何可跑的用例（见 issue #17）。
tests/**/__snapshots__/
# 早期回归实验的遗留用例：相对路径已失效且与顶层同名用例重复，不纳入版本库。
tests/reverted-ui/
*_TEST_REPORT.md
*_DEBUG_GUIDE.md
*_GUIDE.md

